  "details": "- CVE-2026-91097: bound LEDM HTTP response copies to the caller's buffer in\n  http_read() of the SANE hpaio backend (backport of HPLIP 3.26.6)\n- CVE-2026-91098: bound device-supplied data in the LEDM scan backend\n  (parse_scan_elements(), bb_start_scan(), get_size()) (backport of\n  HPLIP 3.26.6 and RHEL 9)\n- CVE-2026-91101: validate device-supplied channel ids and data lengths in\n  libhpmud MLC/DOT4 reverse-command handling (backport of HPLIP 3.26.6)\n- CVE-2026-91103: reject MFPDTF blocks shorter than their header in\n  MfpdtfReadService() of the SANE hpaio backend (backport of HPLIP 3.26.6)\n- CVE-2026-91104: size the hpcups printer buffer from each page header in\n  HPCupsFilter::processRasterData() (backport of HPLIP 3.26.6)\n- CVE-2026-91105: fix buffer overflows in the hpps PostScript filter\n  (backport of HPLIP 3.26.6 and RHEL 9)",
